@startuml ref-adapter
!include _style.puml
title Adapter (object) - GoF Reference Structure\n(Source: Gamma, Helm, Johnson, Vlissides. Design Patterns. Addison-Wesley, 1995)
class Client
interface Target {
  +request()
}
class Adapter {
  +request()
}
class Adaptee {
  +specificRequest()
}
Target <|.. Adapter
Adapter o--> Adaptee
Client --> Target
note bottom of Adapter : request() delegates to\nadaptee.specificRequest()
@enduml
